>Growth in this business doesn\u2019t come without its challenges. Once your production scales you won't be able to keep up on your own. Hire workers to help you out. Each worker possesses a unique level of skill for different tasks, it\u2019s your job as the manager of your empire to assign the tasks in the most optimal way. Experiment with task priorities and amounts to see which combination fits your production line the best.</p>","developers":["Duhndal"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450700/c0c67dbf06dd5957ad29e0308ce4722f347a4b4e/header.jpg?t=1766081201","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2450700/1294652955/5c1a006bb633ce3668085f3f5d62002db94534a5/1765899107/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766081196","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2450700/1294652955/5c1a006bb633ce3668085f3f5d62002db94534a5/1765899107/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766081196","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2450700/1294652955/5c1a006bb633ce3668085f3f5d62002db94534a5/1765899107/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766081196","id":257250883,"name":"Drug Lord Tycoon Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257250883/695d2667d77ea39e07d9cb9225d95289097a60ea/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766081196"}],"name":"Drug Lord Tycoon","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Drug Lord Tycoon - $9.99 USD","packageid":881987,"percent_savi